{"id":"n54982-2-7","stage":1,"title":"멋 · 风采","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54982-2-7-1","ko":"주말에 지리산에 다녀왔다면서? 어땠어?","zh":"听说你周末去了智异山？感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"지리산에","meaning":"智异山","explanation":"지리산：智异山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지리산에","audio":"/audio/56cc70efc6e1b7055cd8.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지리산에","audio":"/audio/56cc70efc6e1b7055cd8.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔다면서?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔다면서","audio":"/audio/6405508b5fea9a407026.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8fe8f47a078662bf5271.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54982-2-7-2","ko":"좋았어. 자연의 멋을 한껏 느끼고 왔지.","zh":"很不错。充分感受到了大自然的壮美。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋았어.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았어","audio":"/audio/cd6dc803ada138294ae4.mp3"}},{"text":"자연의","meaning":"自然","explanation":"자연：自然；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"자연","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62392","senseId":"2","lemma":"자연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자연의","audio":"/audio/9bb9da667c3884ccf075.mp3"}},{"text":"멋을","meaning":"风采，韵味，风味","explanation":"멋：风采，韵味，风味；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"멋","audio":"/audio/96240bc9fb8b95c672d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54982","senseId":"2","lemma":"멋","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋을","audio":"/audio/6078bdbbb94012c482c2.mp3"}},{"text":"한껏","meaning":"尽量，尽情","explanation":"한껏：尽量，尽情","readings":[{"term":"한껏","audio":"/audio/813acf35498f60c4109b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84111","senseId":"1","lemma":"한껏","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한껏","audio":"/audio/813acf35498f60c4109b.mp3"}},{"text":"느끼고","meaning":"感受，体会","explanation":"느끼다：感受，体会；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"5","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느끼고","audio":"/audio/66956b835ea196b41ae1.mp3"}},{"text":"왔지.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔지","audio":"/audio/30d1e06f5e1b21e898aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"130c1a6579678dd9","term":"자연","zh":"自然","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3","entryId":"62392","definition":"没有经过人的加工，自然形成的山、江、海等地理环境。","pronunciation":["자연"]},{"id":"96240bc9fb8b95c6","term":"멋","zh":"风采，韵味，风味","audio":"/audio/96240bc9fb8b95c672d4.mp3","entryId":"54982","definition":"指水准很高、看上去很好的氛围或印象。","pronunciation":["먿"]},{"id":"813acf35498f60c4","term":"한껏","zh":"尽量，尽情","audio":"/audio/813acf35498f60c4109b.mp3","entryId":"84111","definition":"力所能及地。","pronunciation":["한ː껃"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，体会","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"亲自体验某事物，并对此有所了解。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c83e74a8055694a01261.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.136,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54982","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你周末去了智异山？感觉怎么样？","很不错。充分感受到了大自然的壮美。","谁愿意带新生们去宿舍呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你周末去了智异山？感觉怎么样？","很不错。充分感受到了大自然的壮美。","谁愿意带新生们去宿舍呢？"],"answer":1}]}
